WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.417
(beatboxing)

00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:11.770
♪ New Father Chronicles. ♪

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:13.468
- [La Guardia] I filmed the beginnings

00:00:13.468 --> 00:00:15.051
of this journey of fatherhood,

00:00:15.051 --> 00:00:18.364
along that way, it turned into a career.

00:00:18.364 --> 00:00:21.498
So something that was a
passion allowed me to take care

00:00:21.498 --> 00:00:23.392
of my family doing
something I really loved.

00:00:23.392 --> 00:00:26.428
I just want you to stop
eating random things

00:00:26.428 --> 00:00:27.757
you find on the ground.

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:29.412
- Gimme a reason!

00:00:29.412 --> 00:00:34.153
- My name is La Guardia Cross,
and I tell the funniest parts

00:00:34.153 --> 00:00:38.348
of being a father, with my
two daughters, on YouTube.

00:00:38.348 --> 00:00:40.931
Mainly by making fun of myself.

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:49.523
Fatherhood came unexpectedly to me,

00:00:49.523 --> 00:00:51.657
when my wife called me
in and let me know that,

00:00:51.657 --> 00:00:56.063
whoopsie daisy, we're
about to have a daughter.

00:00:56.063 --> 00:00:58.271
The beginning of me sharing my experience

00:00:58.271 --> 00:01:02.907
as a father online was day two
of me being in the hospital.

00:01:02.907 --> 00:01:05.983
I described my first few
days of being a father,

00:01:05.983 --> 00:01:09.367
and so when I did that,
the response was like,

00:01:09.367 --> 00:01:12.270
"That's hilarious, you gotta
share more about that."

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:17.182
And that was the beginning
of New Father Chronicles.

00:01:17.182 --> 00:01:18.895
Nayely's a year and a half.

00:01:18.895 --> 00:01:20.283
- Daddy.

00:01:20.283 --> 00:01:22.783
- Nayely is a determined baby.

00:01:23.741 --> 00:01:25.535
Amalah is 3.

00:01:25.535 --> 00:01:28.450
She really, really loves attention.

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:30.783
- Close, close, close.

00:01:30.783 --> 00:01:32.428
Far away.

00:01:32.428 --> 00:01:35.614
- So, whatever happens,
I usually will take that

00:01:35.614 --> 00:01:37.323
and craft it into a story

00:01:37.323 --> 00:01:40.584
based upon the funniest parts of it.

00:01:40.584 --> 00:01:44.539
The very first video that
solidified New Father Chronicles

00:01:44.539 --> 00:01:46.890
was 'Interview with a toddler."

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:49.109
So you've been alive for 14 months now,

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:51.136
you're walkin, you're
talkin, you're clappin,

00:01:51.136 --> 00:01:51.986
(hands clapping)

00:01:51.986 --> 00:01:53.360
you're dancin, (baby laughs)

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:55.193
you don't have to do an example.

00:01:55.193 --> 00:01:58.008
It allowed an open door
to be able to create

00:01:58.008 --> 00:02:00.289
a whole new kind of family entertainment,

00:02:00.289 --> 00:02:05.234
showcasing a very silly,
but positive black family.

00:02:05.234 --> 00:02:07.720
As the newest and youngest
member of the family

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:10.359
from your perspective, who
do you think is in charge?

00:02:10.359 --> 00:02:12.213
- (baby gibberish)

00:02:12.213 --> 00:02:17.171
- (laughs) Oh, you're
so cute and so confused.

00:02:17.171 --> 00:02:18.020
(bright piano music)

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:20.467
The thing that kind of
really hit me to let me know

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:22.549
how important the work I was doing was,

00:02:22.549 --> 00:02:25.577
when I spoke to people
about it, they were like,

00:02:25.577 --> 00:02:28.833
"Let us just tell you how
important this work is,

00:02:28.833 --> 00:02:32.082
"and what it means to
us, and to our families,

00:02:32.082 --> 00:02:33.823
"and in the community overall."

00:02:33.823 --> 00:02:36.924
And it just was a motivating factor.

00:02:36.924 --> 00:02:41.408
There are not a whole lot
of black fathers on YouTube

00:02:41.408 --> 00:02:42.449
doing what I'm doing.

00:02:42.449 --> 00:02:44.257
It is a blessing to me
to be in this space,

00:02:44.257 --> 00:02:46.307
to be able to create
the content I'm making.

00:02:46.307 --> 00:02:48.239
So it's been incredible to connect

00:02:48.239 --> 00:02:49.842
with other fathers online.

00:02:49.842 --> 00:02:53.567
I'm a cool Dad; I don't
care what my girls say.

00:02:53.567 --> 00:02:56.900
(happy classical music)

